## 2: Initialize a 2D Array
We initialize a 2D array, `dp`, with dimensions `(len(S) + 1) x (len(T) + 1)`, where `dp[i][j]` represents the length of the LCS of the first `i` characters in `S` and the first `j` characters in `T`.

## 3: Fill the 2D Array
